# Shared skills

`.cursor/skills` is a directory junction to `.claude/skills`. Both paths are the same files.

- Add or edit a skill only under `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. Editing the `.cursor/skills` path changes the same file.
- Do not copy a skill into the other tree.
- If `.cursor/skills` is missing, or it is a real directory instead of a junction, run `powershell -File scripts/link-cursor-skills.ps1`.
- Setup and what happens on another machine: `docs/skills.md`.
